ext":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋（えいほう）学園２年Ａ組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋学園に入る前はかなりやんちゃだったらしく、不良達の間では結構有名らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり周囲とは係わろうとしないし、周囲も彼の事を少し恐れているのか話しかけようとする者もいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、幼なじみの神南彩夏だけは彼をタケちゃんと呼び親しく話しかけ、彼も彩夏には頭が上がらないようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6228","sourceWorkId":"21456","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c32320","characterName":"神南 彩夏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"34195","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"124400"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6226"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32320"},"originalCharacterName":"神南 彩夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋学園２年Ａ組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績も良く、人当たりも良いという事で先生やクラスの人からの人気は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、とある事から健流とセックスをしてみる事になり、奇妙な関係が始まる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも明るい笑顔で楽しそうにしている彼女だが…。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6226","sourceWorkId":"21456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神南 彩夏 （じんなん あやか）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋学園 2年A組。 同健流是青梅竹马的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成绩优秀人缘良好，不管是老师还是同学中间都是人气极高的中心人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为某事的关系同健流发生了关系之后，二人奇妙的关系就此开始了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是笑容满满看上去开朗健气的她，却是……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「呐，我们俩这算是属于肉体关系吗？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"34195"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ceb5e5b9d026c66a77d3bac466da5dc67a65d2cec74530b6fe7b40862667ba1a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37f7a2ac0c484660ac3c98ca3f4a03afb3d871e2243eec9cb82fd569963676e2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:124400:34195:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32322","characterName":"宮益 瞳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"34197","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"124400"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6227"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32322"},"originalCharacterName":"宮益 瞳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋学園２年Ａ組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏になり突然やってきたドイツ人クォーターの転入生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲に馴染もうとせず、その見た目と行動からクラスの人からはウザがられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日、教室で健流と彩夏のセックスを見てしまい彼女の運命が変わっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6227","sourceWorkId":"21456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宮益 瞳 （みやます ひとみ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英朋学園 2年A組。 夏天刚转学而来的德国留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"似乎本人并没有积极和周围打好关系的打算，再加上那异样的外貌以及特立独行的言行也是使得她很快的便被从班级之中给孤立了出去。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"某日，偶然目睹了教室中健流与彩夏交欢的场面，使得她的命运产生了巨大的变化。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「因为我是机器人……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"34197"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c70e409ee56c329412985ae2b4a863531a60e4e35d51d386fe4f0893d35f112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea5cdccf5775880db75b38be9d860cdf2b6cdc20563ee8b80167dccf0629bf18.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLab